```bash
### 1. Turn off ipfilter temporarily so we can work

pfexec svcadm disable network/ipfilter

### (if that says unknown FMRI, try: pfexec svcadm disable ipfilter)

### 2. Tear down the conflicting fake network completely

pfexec ipadm delete-addr fake_external0/external

pfexec ipadm delete-if fake_external0

pfexec dladm delete-vnic fake_external0

pfexec dladm delete-etherstub fake_external_stub0

```